<div class="project-header">
    <h1>CampusSync - Smart Campus ERP</h1>
    <div class="project-sub">Project System Architecture &amp; Database Design Documentation</div>
    <div style="margin-top: 8px; font-weight: bold;">Semester 5 Project Report Submission</div>
